Subject: [candle] paged-moe-matmul-kernels

  The pooled and with-hids MoE variants, threaded inside upstream's own kernel_mul_mm / kernel_mul_mm_id bodies, and the tensor-op GEMM in MLX's NAX structure over the same dequantisers (dense and both routed entries, half activations the host casts once per input)
  38e's target, and a rewrite rather than a move — nothing relocates these
  Also the q8_0/q4_K matvec geometry, whose dispatch table disagreed with the kernel bodies it dispatches.

Applies to: 0.10.2
Files: 2

